{
  "info": {
    "name": "Saas Store API",
    "description": "Schema-per-tenant RBAC API. Flow: run `Register Store` first (public self-serve signup, auto-sets tenant_slug + owner tokens), or `Login Platform` to get {{platform_token}} for the Platform folder. Set `tenant_slug` to target a tenant; Users/Roles/Permissions/Products/Categories folders auto-send `x-tenant-slug`. Login stores access_token/refresh_token; Refresh rotates them (old refresh token is revoked). List Users/Roles/Permissions/Tenants/Products/Categories auto-set user_id/role_id/permission_id/tenant_id/product_id/category_id (list/upload also set image_id). Users/Roles/Permissions/Products/Categories folders use Bearer {{access_token}}; Platform folder uses Bearer {{platform_token}} (tenant tokens are rejected on platform routes with 403). Custom role keys must match ^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*$ ; uppercase keys are reserved system roles (create/rename to them -> 409, rename/delete of system roles -> 409). Create Permission key must be a valid permission key (409 if already seeded). Products: SKU must match ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$ (duplicate -> 400), optional categoryId must reference an existing category (unknown -> 400), images are jpeg/png/webp/gif multipart `file` field (quota + count limits -> 413/400). Categories: each tenant is seeded with 8 base categories on provision/re-seed; slug is auto-derived from name when omitted and must be unique (duplicate -> 400), deleting a category nulls products.categoryId.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
